0..75 Comment "//! This source supplies the identity subject\'s shared circle declarations."
76..79 Comment "//!"
80..140 Comment "//! The declarations provide the circle, its loop words, and"
141..165 Comment "//! their integer model."
166..240 Comment "//! Winding and spinning follow the HoTT book\'s § 8.1. The circle follows"
241..288 Comment "//! cubical Agda\'s `Cubical/HITs/S1/Base.agda`."
289..292 Comment "//!"
293..365 Comment "//! Each subject source imports these declarations to state its own law."
366..424 Comment "//! The checker evaluates their rules and path operations."
425..428 Comment "//!"
